    what: "M3.2 (#248): a Tool Station saved with every one of its seven slots full -- a loaded tool, the donor part, the four parity reagents (green/blue/magma slime crystal + gold block) across the five free slots, and the embossed result still in the output slot, which #248 moved from index 5 to index 6 when it grew the container from six slots to seven. This is the seven-entry inventory list only a post-#248 world can write; m2_tool_station_inventory.snbt stays as the old-shape proof that shorter lists keep loading (SimpleContainer's list is positionless -- entries reload in order via addItem, so a six-slot save's stacks all land in the wider container, and anything that reloads into a slot its tab doesn't use is handed back by ToolStationMenu#returnUnusableInputs; visible relocation, no loss)."
